  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f479d491-e048-4d8f-8e2b-b0295bcda028-image.png\" style=\"width: 167px; height: 120px;\" />​​​​​​​</p><p>In the above reaction, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of toluene is converted into benzaldehyde with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>92</mn><mo>%</mo></math> yield. The amount of benzaldehyde produced is____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&times;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p>",
