  "correctValue": "530",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d759ccde-f1d1-4602-bee4-b97cad465b41-eb97674b-ed8f-4c71-afc8-3cd97108959a-image.png\" style=\"width: 336px; height: 158px;\" /></p><p>Molar mass of benzaldehyde=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>106</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p>Number of moles of toluene&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>92</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Number&nbsp;of moles of Benzaldehyde&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>92</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Mass of Benzaldehyde&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>92</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>106</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>530</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
